{"title":"Aug 8 — Final Seoul Day","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Aug 8 — Final Seoul Day"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"day-hero\">\n  <div class=\"day-badge\">Saturday · August 8, 2026 · Day 14 of 15</div>\n  <h1 class=\"day-title\">Final Seoul Day 🛍️</h1>\n  <div class=\"day-subtitle\">📍 Head Spa · Han River Bikes · COEX · K-pop · 논현삼계탕 · SeoulMong · Lotte Tower · Seoul</div>\n  <div class=\"pending-badge\">🔧 Needs Fixes</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"map-aug08\" class=\"day-map\"></div>\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var map = L.map('map-aug08').setView([37.5200, 127.0550], 12);\n  L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {\n    attribution: '© <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OSM</a>'\n  }).addTo(map);\n  function dot(c) {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:'+c+';border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\"></div>', iconSize:[13,13], iconAnchor:[6,6], popupAnchor:[0,-8] });\n  }\n  function hotelDot() {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A148C;border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;line-height:1;color:#fff\">★</div>', iconSize:[22,22], iconAnchor:[11,11], popupAnchor:[0,-13] });\n  }\n  var pts = [\n    { name:'🏨 Hotel — Voco Myeongdong or Gangnam (TBD)', lat:37.5572, lng:126.9680, hotel:true, url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Voco+Myeongdong+Seoul' },\n    { name:'EcoJardin Head Spa 💆 (Aeogae)', lat:37.5572, lng:126.9476, c:'#26A69A', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=EcoJardin+head+spa+Aeogae+Seoul' },\n    { name:'Han River Biking 🚲', lat:37.5263, lng:126.9348, c:'#1565C0', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Han+River+bike+rental+Seoul' },\n    { name:'COEX & Starfield Library 📚', lat:37.5126, lng:127.0594, c:'#1565C0', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=COEX+Starfield+Library+Seoul' },\n    { name:'HYBE Headquarters 🎵', lat:37.5073, lng:127.0391, c:'#C62828', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=HYBE+Headquarters+Seoul' },\n    { name:'SM Entertainment 🎤', lat:37.5178, lng:127.0429, c:'#E53935', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=SM+Entertainment+Seoul' },\n    { name:'JYP Entertainment 🎵', lat:37.5193, lng:127.0282, c:'#FFA726', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=JYP+Entertainment+Seoul' },\n    { name:'YG Entertainment 🎵', lat:37.5795, lng:126.9460, c:'#212121', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=YG+Entertainment+Seoul' },\n    { name:'논현삼계탕 🍗 (Lunch)', lat:37.5161, lng:127.0299, c:'#43A047', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=논현삼계탕+Nonhyeon+Seoul' },\n    { name:'KimbuksoonKeunNambijip 🍲 (Lunch Alt)', lat:37.5200, lng:127.0300, c:'#66BB6A', url:'https://share.google/bsbvExAPWRr1jouiu' },\n    { name:'SeoulMong 🍱 (Final Dinner)', lat:37.5600, lng:126.9850, c:'#C62828', url:'https://share.google/SnMuyIDAcAsxLyQCl' },\n    { name:'Lotte World Tower 🌃', lat:37.5126, lng:127.1021, c:'#8B0000', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lotte+World+Tower+Seoul+Sky' },\n  ];\n  window.pageMap = map; window.pageMarkers = [];\n  pts.forEach(function(p) {\n    var m = L.marker([p.lat, p.lng], { icon: p.hotel ? hotelDot() : dot(p.c) }).addTo(map);\n    var html = '<b>' + p.name + '</b>';\n    if (p.url) html += '<br><a href=\"' + p.url + '\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Open in Maps →</a>';\n    m.bindPopup(html);\n    window.pageMarkers.push({ marker: m, lat: p.lat, lng: p.lng });\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Breakfast — Hotel</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-08T07:00\" data-lat=\"37.5572\" data-lng=\"126.9680\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">07:00–10:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag booked\">INCLUDED ✓</span><span class=\"tag meal\">🍳 Breakfast</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Breakfast — Hotel (Weekend Hours)</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Breakfast included. Check hotel breakfast hours — kitchen typically closes at 10:00–10:30 on weekends. Don't sleep past closing time on the last full day!</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Voco+Myeongdong+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Hotel</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Morning — Head Spa</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-08T09:00\" data-lat=\"37.5572\" data-lng=\"126.9476\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">09:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">💆 Head Spa</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">EcoJardin — Head Spa (Aeogae Branch)</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Korean head spa experience — scalp treatment, deep cleanse, and relaxing head massage. A luxurious way to start the final Seoul day. <strong>Book in advance</strong> — these spots fill up fast, especially on weekends.\n      <ul>\n        <li>Bring a change top if you want — they use a lot of product</li>\n        <li>Usually 60–90 min sessions</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=EcoJardin+head+spa+Aeogae+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 EcoJardin Aeogae</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/에코자딘+애오개+두피케어\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Morning — Han River Biking</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-08T11:00\" data-lat=\"37.5263\" data-lng=\"126.9348\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">11:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🚲 Biking</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Han River Biking</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Rent bikes and cruise the Han River bike path — one of Seoul's most classic activities. Flat, scenic paths along both banks with city skyline views. Rental stations available along the riverside parks.\n      <ul>\n        <li>Yeouido Hangang Park has the most convenient rental stations</li>\n        <li>Bike rentals are very affordable — ₩3,000–5,000/hour</li>\n        <li>Path connects to Banpo, Mapodaegyo, and beyond</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Han+River+bike+rental+Yeouido+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Han River Bikes</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/한강+자전거+대여\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">COEX & Starfield Library</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-08T12:30\" data-lat=\"37.5126\" data-lng=\"127.0594\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">12:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">📚 Library</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">COEX Starfield Library</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Seoul's famous two-storey open bookshelves — thousands of books lining enormous walls inside COEX Mall. A stunning architectural Instagram spot. Free entry. COEX Mall itself is one of Asia's largest underground shopping centres — good for last-minute brand shopping.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=COEX+Starfield+Library+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 COEX</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/별마당도서관+코엑스\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">K-pop Pilgrimage</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-08T11:00\" data-lat=\"37.5073\" data-lng=\"127.0391\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">After COEX</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🎵 K-pop</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">K-pop Company Buildings</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Fan pilgrimage tour of the major K-pop entertainment buildings. Most are in Gangnam / Apgujeong area:\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=HYBE+Headquarters+Yongsan+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>HYBE</strong></a> (BTS, TXT, NewJeans) — Yongsan</li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=SM+Entertainment+Seolleung+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>SM Entertainment</strong></a> (EXO, aespa, SHINee) — Seolleung</li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=JYP+Entertainment+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>JYP</strong></a> (TWICE, Stray Kids, NMIXX) — Cheongdam</li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=YG+Entertainment+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>YG</strong></a> (BLACKPINK, BIGBANG) — Hapjeong</li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Starship+Entertainment+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Starship</strong></a> (MONSTA X, CRAVITY, IVE)</li>\n      </ul>\n      Most are just the buildings — no tours usually. Some have fan café areas nearby.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=K-pop+entertainment+companies+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Find All</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/하이브+엔터테인먼트+서울\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Lunch</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-08T13:00\" data-lat=\"37.5161\" data-lng=\"127.0299\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">13:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🍗 Lunch Option 1</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">논현삼계탕 본점 — Samgyetang (Ginseng Chicken)</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Famous samgyetang (ginseng chicken soup) restaurant in Nonhyeon. Whole young chicken stuffed with rice, ginseng, jujube, and garlic in a nourishing broth. A classic Korean restorative meal — great energy before the final evening out.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=논현삼계탕+본점+Nonhyeon+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 논현삼계탕</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/논현삼계탕+본점\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-08T13:00\" data-lat=\"37.5200\" data-lng=\"127.0300\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">13:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🍲 Lunch Option 2</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">KimbuksoonKeunNambijip — Kimchi Jjigae</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Alternative lunch option — kimchi jjigae (kimchi stew) done right. A bubbling hot pot of aged kimchi, tofu, pork, and broth. One of Korea's most comforting dishes and a great farewell Korean meal.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://share.google/bsbvExAPWRr1jouiu\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Google Maps</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/김복순큰남비집\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Afternoon — Final Shopping</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card shopping\" data-dt=\"2026-08-08T14:30\" data-lat=\"37.5178\" data-lng=\"127.0429\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">14:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag shopping\">🛍️ Final Shopping</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Anything Missed — Luxury Beauty Round 2</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Last chance for any missed brands. Check:\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hera+Beauty+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\">Hera</a> — Korean luxury cosmetics</li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jung+Saem+Mool+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\">Jung Saem Mool</a> — celebrity makeup artist brand</li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Heart+Percent+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\">Heart Percent</a> — indie makeup brand</li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=The+Saem+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\">The Saem</a> — skincare and makeup</li>\n        <li>Final Olive Young top-up</li>\n        <li>Tamburins (if you missed Garosugil)</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Korean+beauty+shopping+Gangnam+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Gangnam Beauty</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/강남+뷰티+쇼핑\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Dinner</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-08T19:00\" data-lat=\"37.5600\" data-lng=\"126.9850\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">19:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🍱 Final Korea Dinner</span><span class=\"tag note\">⚠️ Reservation Needed</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">SeoulMong — Izakaya / Sashimi</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Korean izakaya-style sashimi restaurant — a perfect final dinner in Korea. <strong>⚠️ Reservation to be booked — add to the to-do list.</strong></div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://share.google/SnMuyIDAcAsxLyQCl\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Google Maps</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/서울몽\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Evening</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card evening\" data-dt=\"2026-08-08T20:30\" data-lat=\"37.5126\" data-lng=\"127.1021\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">20:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🌃 Night View</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Lotte World Tower — Seoul Sky</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Korea's tallest building (555m) with Seoul Sky Observatory on floors 117–123. Breathtaking night views over Seoul's glittering skyline — a perfect finale to the trip. Includes glass-floored sky bridge.\n      <ul>\n        <li>Book tickets in advance online to skip queues</li>\n        <li>Best visited after dark for city lights</li>\n        <li>Entry ~₩29,000</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lotte+World+Tower+Seoul+Sky+Observatory\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Lotte Tower</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/롯데월드타워+서울스카이\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"note-box\"><strong>Last night in Korea!</strong> Flight tomorrow. Pack tonight — check-out and head to airport by early afternoon. <strong>Book SeoulMong reservation before it's too late!</strong> Also confirm EcoJardin head spa booking in advance.</div>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"day-hero\">\n  <div class=\"day-badge\">Saturday · August 8, 2026 · Day 14 of 15</div>\n  <h1 class=\"day-title\">Final Seoul Day 🛍️</h1>\n  <div class=\"day-subtitle\">📍 Head Spa · Han River Bikes · COEX · K-pop · 논현삼계탕 · SeoulMong · Lotte Tower · Seoul</div>\n  <div class=\"pending-badge\">🔧 Needs Fixes</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"map-aug08\" class=\"day-map\"></div>\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var map = L.map('map-aug08').setView([37.5200, 127.0550], 12);\n  L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {\n    attribution: '© <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OSM</a>'\n  }).addTo(map);\n  function dot(c) {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:'+c+';border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\"></div>', iconSize:[13,13], iconAnchor:[6,6], popupAnchor:[0,-8] });\n  }\n  function hotelDot() {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A148C;border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;line-height:1;color:#fff\">★</div>', iconSize:[22,22], iconAnchor:[11,11], popupAnchor:[0,-13] });\n  }\n  var pts = [\n    { name:'🏨 Hotel — Voco Myeongdong or Gangnam (TBD)', lat:37.5572, lng:126.9680, hotel:true, url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Voco+Myeongdong+Seoul' },\n    { name:'EcoJardin Head Spa 💆 (Aeogae)', lat:37.5572, lng:126.9476, c:'#26A69A', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=EcoJardin+head+spa+Aeogae+Seoul' },\n    { name:'Han River Biking 🚲', lat:37.5263, lng:126.9348, c:'#1565C0', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Han+River+bike+rental+Seoul' },\n    { name:'COEX & Starfield Library 📚', lat:37.5126, lng:127.0594, c:'#1565C0', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=COEX+Starfield+Library+Seoul' },\n    { name:'HYBE Headquarters 🎵', lat:37.5073, lng:127.0391, c:'#C62828', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=HYBE+Headquarters+Seoul' },\n    { name:'SM Entertainment 🎤', lat:37.5178, lng:127.0429, c:'#E53935', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=SM+Entertainment+Seoul' },\n    { name:'JYP Entertainment 🎵', lat:37.5193, lng:127.0282, c:'#FFA726', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=JYP+Entertainment+Seoul' },\n    { name:'YG Entertainment 🎵', lat:37.5795, lng:126.9460, c:'#212121', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=YG+Entertainment+Seoul' },\n    { name:'논현삼계탕 🍗 (Lunch)', lat:37.5161, lng:127.0299, c:'#43A047', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=논현삼계탕+Nonhyeon+Seoul' },\n    { name:'KimbuksoonKeunNambijip 🍲 (Lunch Alt)', lat:37.5200, lng:127.0300, c:'#66BB6A', url:'https://share.google/bsbvExAPWRr1jouiu' },\n    { name:'SeoulMong 🍱 (Final Dinner)', lat:37.5600, lng:126.9850, c:'#C62828', url:'https://share.google/SnMuyIDAcAsxLyQCl' },\n    { name:'Lotte World Tower 🌃', lat:37.5126, lng:127.1021, c:'#8B0000', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lotte+World+Tower+Seoul+Sky' },\n  ];\n  window.pageMap = map; window.pageMarkers = [];\n  pts.forEach(function(p) {\n    var m = L.marker([p.lat, p.lng], { icon: p.hotel ? hotelDot() : dot(p.c) }).addTo(map);\n    var html = '<b>' + p.name + '</b>';\n    if (p.url) html += '<br><a href=\"' + p.url + '\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Open in Maps →</a>';\n    m.bindPopup(html);\n    window.pageMarkers.push({ marker: m, lat: p.lat, lng: p.lng });\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Breakfast — Hotel</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-08T07:00\" data-lat=\"37.5572\" data-lng=\"126.9680\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">07:00–10:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag booked\">INCLUDED ✓</span><span class=\"tag meal\">🍳 Breakfast</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Breakfast — Hotel (Weekend Hours)</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Breakfast included. Check hotel breakfast hours — kitchen typically closes at 10:00–10:30 on weekends. Don't sleep past closing time on the last full day!</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Voco+Myeongdong+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Hotel</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Morning — Head Spa</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-08T09:00\" data-lat=\"37.5572\" data-lng=\"126.9476\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">09:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">💆 Head Spa</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">EcoJardin — Head Spa (Aeogae Branch)</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Korean head spa experience — scalp treatment, deep cleanse, and relaxing head massage. A luxurious way to start the final Seoul day. <strong>Book in advance</strong> — these spots fill up fast, especially on weekends.\n      <ul>\n        <li>Bring a change top if you want — they use a lot of product</li>\n        <li>Usually 60–90 min sessions</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=EcoJardin+head+spa+Aeogae+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 EcoJardin Aeogae</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/에코자딘+애오개+두피케어\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Morning — Han River Biking</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-08T11:00\" data-lat=\"37.5263\" data-lng=\"126.9348\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">11:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🚲 Biking</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Han River Biking</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Rent bikes and cruise the Han River bike path — one of Seoul's most classic activities. Flat, scenic paths along both banks with city skyline views. Rental stations available along the riverside parks.\n      <ul>\n        <li>Yeouido Hangang Park has the most convenient rental stations</li>\n        <li>Bike rentals are very affordable — ₩3,000–5,000/hour</li>\n        <li>Path connects to Banpo, Mapodaegyo, and beyond</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Han+River+bike+rental+Yeouido+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Han River Bikes</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/한강+자전거+대여\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">COEX & Starfield Library</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-08T12:30\" data-lat=\"37.5126\" data-lng=\"127.0594\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">12:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">📚 Library</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">COEX Starfield Library</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Seoul's famous two-storey open bookshelves — thousands of books lining enormous walls inside COEX Mall. A stunning architectural Instagram spot. Free entry. COEX Mall itself is one of Asia's largest underground shopping centres — good for last-minute brand shopping.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=COEX+Starfield+Library+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 COEX</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/별마당도서관+코엑스\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">K-pop Pilgrimage</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-08T11:00\" data-lat=\"37.5073\" data-lng=\"127.0391\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">After COEX</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🎵 K-pop</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">K-pop Company Buildings</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Fan pilgrimage tour of the major K-pop entertainment buildings. Most are in Gangnam / Apgujeong area:\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=HYBE+Headquarters+Yongsan+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>HYBE</strong></a> (BTS, TXT, NewJeans) — Yongsan</li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=SM+Entertainment+Seolleung+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>SM Entertainment</strong></a> (EXO, aespa, SHINee) — Seolleung</li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=JYP+Entertainment+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>JYP</strong></a> (TWICE, Stray Kids, NMIXX) — Cheongdam</li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=YG+Entertainment+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>YG</strong></a> (BLACKPINK, BIGBANG) — Hapjeong</li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Starship+Entertainment+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Starship</strong></a> (MONSTA X, CRAVITY, IVE)</li>\n      </ul>\n      Most are just the buildings — no tours usually. Some have fan café areas nearby.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=K-pop+entertainment+companies+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Find All</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/하이브+엔터테인먼트+서울\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Lunch</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-08T13:00\" data-lat=\"37.5161\" data-lng=\"127.0299\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">13:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🍗 Lunch Option 1</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">논현삼계탕 본점 — Samgyetang (Ginseng Chicken)</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Famous samgyetang (ginseng chicken soup) restaurant in Nonhyeon. Whole young chicken stuffed with rice, ginseng, jujube, and garlic in a nourishing broth. A classic Korean restorative meal — great energy before the final evening out.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=논현삼계탕+본점+Nonhyeon+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 논현삼계탕</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/논현삼계탕+본점\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-08T13:00\" data-lat=\"37.5200\" data-lng=\"127.0300\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">13:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🍲 Lunch Option 2</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">KimbuksoonKeunNambijip — Kimchi Jjigae</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Alternative lunch option — kimchi jjigae (kimchi stew) done right. A bubbling hot pot of aged kimchi, tofu, pork, and broth. One of Korea's most comforting dishes and a great farewell Korean meal.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://share.google/bsbvExAPWRr1jouiu\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Google Maps</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/김복순큰남비집\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Afternoon — Final Shopping</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card shopping\" data-dt=\"2026-08-08T14:30\" data-lat=\"37.5178\" data-lng=\"127.0429\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">14:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag shopping\">🛍️ Final Shopping</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Anything Missed — Luxury Beauty Round 2</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Last chance for any missed brands. Check:\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hera+Beauty+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\">Hera</a> — Korean luxury cosmetics</li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jung+Saem+Mool+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\">Jung Saem Mool</a> — celebrity makeup artist brand</li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Heart+Percent+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\">Heart Percent</a> — indie makeup brand</li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=The+Saem+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\">The Saem</a> — skincare and makeup</li>\n        <li>Final Olive Young top-up</li>\n        <li>Tamburins (if you missed Garosugil)</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Korean+beauty+shopping+Gangnam+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Gangnam Beauty</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/강남+뷰티+쇼핑\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Dinner</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-08T19:00\" data-lat=\"37.5600\" data-lng=\"126.9850\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">19:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🍱 Final Korea Dinner</span><span class=\"tag note\">⚠️ Reservation Needed</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">SeoulMong — Izakaya / Sashimi</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Korean izakaya-style sashimi restaurant — a perfect final dinner in Korea. <strong>⚠️ Reservation to be booked — add to the to-do list.</strong></div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://share.google/SnMuyIDAcAsxLyQCl\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Google Maps</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/서울몽\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Evening</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card evening\" data-dt=\"2026-08-08T20:30\" data-lat=\"37.5126\" data-lng=\"127.1021\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">20:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🌃 Night View</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Lotte World Tower — Seoul Sky</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Korea's tallest building (555m) with Seoul Sky Observatory on floors 117–123. Breathtaking night views over Seoul's glittering skyline — a perfect finale to the trip. Includes glass-floored sky bridge.\n      <ul>\n        <li>Book tickets in advance online to skip queues</li>\n        <li>Best visited after dark for city lights</li>\n        <li>Entry ~₩29,000</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lotte+World+Tower+Seoul+Sky+Observatory\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Lotte Tower</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/롯데월드타워+서울스카이\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"note-box\"><strong>Last night in Korea!</strong> Flight tomorrow. Pack tonight — check-out and head to airport by early afternoon. <strong>Book SeoulMong reservation before it's too late!</strong> Also confirm EcoJardin head spa booking in advance.</div>\n```\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":fal